Z||000003||jimmybpei||08-24-2001||09:09 PM||||This will require extending the rear deck lid <BR>the lock and key as well as making a new mounting setup for the fast back tails.<P>Once you have done this it is just a matter of hacking and fiberglassing everthing till it fits. <P>Sounds easy, NOT but looks SWEEEEET.<BR> <BR>Skitime has pic if he would through them on so you couls see as i dont have any digital pic of my cars.<P>thanks for the reply and if anyone has done anotchback to fastback conversion and has gotten the signals to work i would like to know how<P>Thankx <BR>Jimmy B.||||reg||1
